: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지식재산능력시험이란</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">? </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" /--><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\" stroked=\"f\" filled=\"f\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" o:spt=\"75\" coordsize=\"21600,21600\"><v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f><v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:connecttype=\"rect\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:extrusionok=\"f\"></v:path><o:lock aspectratio=\"t\" v:ext=\"edit\"></o:lock></v:shapetype></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><v:shape style=\"WIDTH: 99.64pt; HEIGHT: 20.69pt; v-text-anchor: top\" id=\"_x172998104\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"><v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:\\Users\\cho\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\Hnc\\BinData\\EMB00002bb80ab9.bmp\" o:title=\"EMB00002bb80ab9\"></v:imagedata><!--?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\" /--><w:wrap type=\"topAndBottom\"></w:wrap></v:shape></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지식재산의 가치증대로 특허경영이 기업경영의 핵심으로 부상하여 지식재산능력을 지닌 융합형 지식재산인력을 배양하고자 한국발명진흥회서 주관하는 공인시험</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">배경 및 목적</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">지식재산의 가치증대로 기업은 지식재산 경쟁력 확보를 위하여 지식재산 창출에서 활용</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">전략수립이 가능한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">“</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">융합형 지식재산 인력</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">”</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">을 절실히 필요함 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이에 그동안 특허교육에서 배운 지식을 시험을 통해 검증해 보고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기업의 지식재산 직무범위와 실무역량에 필요한 능력을 갖춘 인재를 양성하여 융합형 지식재산인력을 지원하고자 함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지원내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12